          "type": "heading",
          "text": "1. Network and Build",
          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "`docker network inspect` lists members and subnet",
            "`docker exec c ping db` or `curl` tests the service name",
            "`docker port c` verifies the published mapping",
            "`docker build --progress=plain --no-cache` rules out stale cache",
            "Crash loop: `--entrypoint sh` inspects without starting the app"
          ],
          "style": "check",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "2. Logs and Disk",
          "ink": "green"
