    {
      "page_title": "Core Docker Interview Answers",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "1. Definition: Two Core Pairs",
          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "==Container== vs VM: shared kernel, isolated by namespaces and cgroups",
            "A VM boots a full guest OS on a hypervisor",
            "==Image== vs container: immutable layered template vs running instance",
            "The container adds a **writable** layer on top"
          ],
          "style": "dot",
          "frame": "none"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "2. Mechanism: Build Questions",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "==ENTRYPOINT== fixes the executable; CMD supplies default arguments",
            "Run-time args replace CMD; ENTRYPOINT stays",
            "`COPY` is plain copy; `ADD` also extracts tars and fetches URLs, so prefer COPY",
            "==Cache==: unchanged instruction and inputs reuse the layer",
            "One change invalidates **every** layer after it"
          ],
          "style": "dot",
          "frame": "none"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "3. Example: Review This Dockerfile",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "dockerfile",
          "lines": [
            "FROM golang:1.23 AS build",
            "COPY . .",
            "RUN go build -o /app",
            "FROM gcr.io/distroless/static",
            "COPY --from=build /app /app",
            "ENTRYPOINT [\"/app\"]"
          ],
          "note": "COPY . . early busts the cache",
          "result": {
            "headers": [
              "Stage",
              "Ships?"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "build",
                "no"
              ],
              [
                "final",
                "yes"
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Slim or ==distroless== base image",
            "Multi-stage builds ship only the artifact",
            "Combine RUN steps into one layer",
            "Add a `.dockerignore` for the context"
          ],
          "style": "check",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "green"
        },
